    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105">

                <pb facs="0205" n="185" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v2/pg185"/>

                <head>A.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sandridge</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1871-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 20,
                        1871</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><seg type="margin">[718]</seg>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Referring to the conversation I had
                    with you in relation to the steamship Shenandoah, I must, oh second
                    consideration, decline <pb facs="0206" n="186" xml:id="pg186"/> (for private
                    reasons) giving *you the information I promised you.</p>
                <p>Trusting you will not consider this refusal any want of respect to or confidence
                    in you,</p>
                <p>I remain, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN K. COLLINS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Stevedore.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Samuel P. Lord</hi>, Esq.,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Melbourne.</hi></p>
                    <p>This is the exhibit, marked A, referred to in the affidavit of Samuel Perkins
                        Lord, sworn before me this 25th day of September, 1871.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>W. ATTENBOROUGH,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">A Commissioner of the
                                Supreme Court of the Colony of Victoria for taking
                            Affidavits.</hi></signed>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d105-a1.xml" xpointer="d105-a1"/>
            </div>
